Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:05.58,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“PMF was the moment our
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:05.58,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}users got mad at us”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel like for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,us, it was the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:05.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,that our users were so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,mad at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like, it means that your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,users really care about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,the problem you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,solving. And you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:10.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,probably are solving it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:11.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a way they don't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,really like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,but they still need the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:15.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,solution you provide so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,they become so mad at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:18.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,you and we got really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:20.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,long like a user email
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,like talking about like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,why you really suck at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,the product and why you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:24.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,cannot really solve that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,problem really well and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,at all like I know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:28.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,they're really mad at us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,like but I know exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:30.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,that we are solving a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,problem people really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:33.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,care about But before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:34.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,that, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:35.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,we actually have at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:38.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,least one month that we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,could not get any user
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:40.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,feedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:40.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Since, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:42.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,after user first sign
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:43.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,up, we have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, 24 hours clock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:46.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,and right after 24
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:47.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours, we're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:48.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, send an email to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:49.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask for feedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:50.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,And then for a month
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:51.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, we haven't got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:51.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,back, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:52.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,any feedback from the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:00:53.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,email, and we were kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:54.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,of really stressed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:55.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,And after that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:56.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,we make some changes and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.71,0:00:57.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,make the product
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:00:59.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,positioning much
